aude runs on your own computer and works in one folder you choose, with your email, calendar and files connected. You can start using it the same day.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_28", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1840, "y": -90, "width": 2092, "height": 218, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1236683273, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 314395343, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_29", "type": "text", "x": 1862, "y": -74, "width": 2048, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 507088657, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1795823849, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - YOUR FIRST SKILLS", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - YOUR FIRST SKILLS", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_30", "type": "text", "x": 1862, "y": -38, "width": 2048, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 708506837, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1469118511, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A skill is a set of saved instructions that Claude reuses, so you explain a task once and get the same result every time. We start with four everyday tasks and test each one on a real example.", "f